From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nostalfinals <yuu8583@proton.me>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 01:23:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add Content System server core

Add add-only ITEM and DATA_COMPONENT_TYPE registry builders with scoped registration keys, immutable ContentSystemItem definitions, custom Paper adapters, and metadata-backed persistence. Custom component values remain transient to vanilla codec and network paths while the Nix projection and recovery service carries persistent state in custom_data envelopes.

Expose actual ItemType identity and configured Material compatibility through CraftBukkit, including generic custom ItemMeta handling, type-preserving conversion, copying, and similarity. Wire the server-owned ContentSystem service and projection-aware remote slot state.

Dispatch the currently available Item virtual hooks through typed Bukkit contexts with default-operation parity, isolated callback fallback, validation, and rate-limited diagnostics. Enriched overload methods are provided for the later NMS call-site patch without changing generated Minecraft sources here.

Projection does a small component reconciliation and only allocates modifier transaction state for stacks with Content System projection work. Persistent component codecs and envelope copies add bounded per-serialization allocations; runtime stacks remain authoritative and custom component values are not deep-copied. The trade-off is a server-side bridge in CraftBukkit and a narrow dependency on the Nix API types, while vanilla items retain their existing behavior.

